Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time you'd reached\Nme, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Death has me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Up above them, it's a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, those morons\Nhave no means of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Admittedly, the weather is quite lovely\Nfor a blind date at the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that Green Tea\Nand I will have to rain on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to exterminate the mold before\Nit has a chance to reach the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, our underground friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My first victim will be you, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to the moon\Nand I'll be back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming back to the moon\Nand I'll be back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.87,0:01:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the year is\Nthe end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,survive the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the year is\Nthe end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:02:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,of the year
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,is the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When I die, I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.44,0:02:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, ambushed me like that earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope for your sake\Nthat you've learned a new trick
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz I'm not falling for it.\NThis time, you dirty son of a!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Son
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.98,0:02:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirty son of a flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You dirty son of a brick, son\Nof a porch and awaited the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You want his bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:03:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that, what you some\Nkind of language experts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn bastard-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot I'm supposed\Nto get this on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing you shouldn't\Ntake more than a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Zippermen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,how did he react so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If this fight's gonna be a one-on-one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then there won't be a need\Nfor me to go underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His powers eclipse Zippermans,\Nboth in strength and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where his strength comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the elbow strikes to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using the recoil\Nto augment his punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it's almost like a boxer trying to spring\Noff the ropes to get some added snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, there's\Nnot a trace of mold on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Chocolata's green tea was supposed\Nto ravage any living thing it touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So how the hell are\Nyou still in one piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to do\Nit the old-fashioned way!.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,beating you over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,until your body stops moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The new thorn in my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn bread is able to breathe\Nlife into inanimate objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,just like he did with\Nthose straight bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The plans gripping this helicopter\Ncouldn't have come from any other source.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're clever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your pathetic life-granting\Npowers are impotent before my green tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch us rot every one of your vines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take off whether they like\Nit or not, so rain down those spores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to whack a few weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn thing won't budge at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we're really stuck here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, piece of junk! Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nearly reached full maturity,\Nand its grip is coming in strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That helicopter isn't gonna\Nfly off anywhere soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, we just have to\Nclimb up to the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, let's climb a tree, then again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just shoot him from here now\Nthat he's within range of my bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go make Daddy proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our point of impact is that\NKatsune skull! What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,White?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The guys are saying the Stranzo's\Nnowhere near the helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the frickin' hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just run off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to hide in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And he couldn't have gone outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, get your feelers out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunt his ass down fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, Mista, you gotta call us back quickly\Nbefore something else terrible happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, fellas, what the\Nhell happened to you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't any of us find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stands are limited to one\Nper person, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy can attack you\Nwith some killer mold
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,that eats your body\Nwhen you lose altitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:06:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be able to do anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Number six, number seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on out of here as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's scary, deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, you have to get your\Nbullets out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw your stand right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's got his\Nclaws in there deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't withdraw jack shit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my judgment was way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just send me in there and I'll fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring everyone back\Nwithout a problem. I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a promise you can keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good reason why he's holding\Non to the bullets he's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows Mista won't be able to heal\Nas long as his stand is activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,he's counting on you to\Nrush in there to save the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,day because he knows that\Nyou're the only one left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you die, so does Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a guy you can\Njust shoot down from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, I'm leaving Trish and Naracha here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch over them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista! Mista! Number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You watched your nose back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this bullet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't get why the bullets\Ncouldn't get a lock on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't nail down his exact spot, but I\Nknow for sure he hasn't left the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In which case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike him down, Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still nothing inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this guy up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes zero sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could hide in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.84,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Medical supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he some kind of doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The chaos is spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty soon, it'll engulf the Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to finish this right now,\Nor we're all going to be screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The real enemy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Number One, come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, get away from it, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're walking right into a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Curiosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.47,0:10:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the primary fuel in the\Nengine of intellectual development.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be\Nquite this grateful for all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,those human experiments I\Nconducted during my youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So many hours I spent analyzing\Nand recording which segments
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,of the human body could be\Nremoved without inducing death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't surprise\Nyou that I therefore know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly which veins I must\Nseal to stop emerging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Green tea's mold can perform\Nthis critical sealing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to maintain\Nmy freedom of movement?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and the ability to hide wherever\NI please even while I'm dissected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't afford to fall\Nany further, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That horrible moat's gonna get\Nyou if you sink lower than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta climb for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We all sometimes have those moments\Nof pure and perfect ecstasy, don't we,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two scenarios I can think\Nof where such joy shines on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The first one starts with despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When a desolate situation becomes\Nhopeful, one starts to feel blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The very moment your oversized\Nweeds snatch me out of the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit I felt something\Nclose to true fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And boy, oh boy, was it\Na dreadful sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I cut through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My years of experience\Ncombined with my sheer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,inner fortitude helped me turn the tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me say, the feelings awaiting\Nme on the other side were blissful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you could get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,John, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really forget that I still had\Ntwo legs crawling about to hear you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:11:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,stupid dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And just what I was about to share with\Nyou, the second source of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,which occurs when beholding\Nthe weak and pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Long before you hit the cold, hard ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,my green tea's malt will\Nhave already reduced?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,your pitiful body to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean, I need this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Run back inside the chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat the Papa out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just getting on my nerves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how many times I can\Nteach you this lesson, my dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got plenty of spores to spare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know a funny thing\Nabout these branches of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're also living things\Nthat my mole loves to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but I hope they don't start to sag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you stand there and\Nyou're gonna jump! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, baby, I want more, show me more, let\Nme see that pretty-faced train of all hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm all tingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd think I'd be used to it by now,\Nbut the sweet sight never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be sure to cheat this way so I can get\Na good look before you go ahead and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bone, looks like my aim for your\Npropellers was right on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a perfect hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew your putrid mold would\Nnaturally end up consuming my branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But, when a branch separates\Nfrom its body, it dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:14:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And because you destroyed the\Nbranch, it returned to bullet form.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and before I forget about all\Nthat creepy happiness bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It might surprise you to hear that seeing\Nyou like this, It brings me no joy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bit, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's cuz I'm the one who's\Nbeen winning this whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez talk about close you managed to\Nstop his mold from spreading further
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to cut your celebration short,\Nbut if you don't mind, scooch a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible I'm overthinking\Nthings a bit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I get the feeling that Cioccolata\Nguy's faking, that he's just playing dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna buy that lame act!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what it is you're plotting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, you're likely thinking\Nto yourself, maybe, just maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could only move\Na little bit that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd be able to escape through the\Ntrench before that stronzo could get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll disperse more mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you're planning\Nin that sick head, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Full disclosure, I'm pretty badly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My right lung has suffered\Na sizable puncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My subclavian artery\Nis completely severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got four cracked ribs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,not to mention my humerus and\Ncarpals are pretty much shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Climbing all the way up there to get to\Nyou would present a challenge, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How lucky for me, then, that my\Nstand is none other than Golden Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It has power in spades\Nand a range of two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you fall well within its reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only take an instant\Nfor us to crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead. Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You already got him right in the noggin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can behave when I get up\Nthere, then I promise to show
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you a little mercy and you'll\Ncome out of this with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing you a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So what'll it be I'm gonna start\Nmaking my way to you think hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting nowhere near me. Look\Nbehind you, you bungling sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, whose hand is that\Non Mista and the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire time you were\Nrunning your worthless mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't even notice my\Nright arm sneaking toward?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,your little friends in the\Nshadows once, now, did ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mista's throat will\Nhave to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you have to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Either you can pursue me, or\Nyou can heal your precious pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's winning now, worthless fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You were close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew out my speech in\Norder to buy myself time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet that tore a hole through\Nyour head still had to mature,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,before eventually making its\Nway back to the initial wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The shrapnel that drew it\Nwas lodged in your skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.52,0:17:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and returned to its\Noriginal form as a beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One whose growth I happened\Nto accelerate greatly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,with golden wind when I\Naimed for the propellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be certain you\Nwere completely neutralized,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.78,0:17:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning I had to finish you off, whether\Nor not I could still hear a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but you said that\Nif I just stayed still,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that I, I would still\Nmake it out of this alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really thought I was being\Nserious, then you're the worthless fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't spare pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:17:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who's waking up from his nappy nap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate me, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd that get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Cioccolata drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he on the phone this entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see it. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell did he call?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.70,0:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Cioccolata!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.94,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't usually take this long. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this flashing thingamaboodle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I press something or...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It means I got a message\Nin my stupid inbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No frickin' duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see here. Wow, there's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And wait, I don't remember him calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it when I was chasing\NBucciarati earlier today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seko, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolata's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of that little\Ntwerp with the gun, Mista. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But that newcomer Giorno looks like he's\Ntrying to come up to the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The sad fool can climb all he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is already mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You finish off that Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that and I'll give you\Nthe bestest back scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think I forgot the sugar cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How many you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How about two?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you rascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you five.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm winding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta catch him\Nwith your muzzle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no hands allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Seiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are unstoppable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and it is the duty of those who are\Nstrong like us to rule over the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One might say we, the mighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,were charged by the heavens to\Nguide the frail and the feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the boss numbers among them, not\Nonly will I destroy those irksome louts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will transcend the boss himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And you shall be by my side,\Nbecause you are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's here. I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to know that you\Nare very dear to me, Seiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That malicious mole should\Nbe far behind by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But they dare to tell us\Nwhat's bad and what's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.76,0:22:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.30,0:22:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just see this light!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power, who's in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are the fighters,\Njust fighting for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
